ube ii bellows type iii aneroid capsule","choices":[{"_id":"693a8ce8cba8ac949a6c5234","isCorrect":false,"choice":"i ii iii"},{"_id":"693a8ce8cba8ac949a6c5235","isCorrect":true,"choice":"iii ii i"},{"_id":"693a8ce8cba8ac949a6c5236","isCorrect":false,"choice":"i iii ii"},{"_id":"693a8ce8cba8ac949a6c5237","isCorrect":false,"choice":"ii iii i"}],"explanation":null,"subject":"Instruments","book":"Pilotshala Practice Set","topic":"Revision 3"},{"image":"","difficulty":"medium","_id":"683fe728452555c3884c7ef8","question":"Sound is propagated at a velocity which is dependent upon:","choices":[{"_id":"693a8ce8cba8ac949a6c5238","isCorrect":false,"choice":"barometric pressure"},{"_id":"693a8ce8cba8ac949a6c5239","isCorrect":false,"choice":"density"},{"_id":"693a8ce8cba8ac949a6c523a","isCorrect":false,"choice":"static pressure"},{"_id":"693a8ce8cba8ac949a6c523b","isCorrect":true,"choice":"temperature"}],"explanation":null,"subject":"Instruments","book":"Pilotshala Practice Set","topic":"Revision 3"},{"image":"","difficulty":"medium","_id":"683fe728452555c3884c7ef9","question":"The local speed of sound at mean sea level at ISA -10°C is:","choices":[{"_id":"693a8ce8cba8ac949a6c523c","isCorrect":false,"choice":"661 kt"},{"_id":"693a8ce8cba8ac949a6c523d","isCorrect":true,"choice":"650 kt"},{"_id":"693a8ce8cba8ac949a6c523e","isCorrect":false,"choice":"673 kt"},{"_id":"693a8ce8cba8ac949a6c523f","isCorrect":false,"choice":"680 kt"}],"explanation":null,"subject":"Instruments","book":"Pilotshala Practice Set","topic":"Revision 3"},{"image":"","difficulty":"medium","_id":"683fe728452555c3884c7efa","question":"What would the compass heading be given a true heading of 247° in an area where the variation is 8°W and a compass deviation of 11°E?","choices":[{"_id":"693a8ce8cba8ac949a6c5240","isCorrect":false,"choice":"255°"},{"_id":"693a8ce8cba8ac949a6c5241","isCorrect":true,"choice":"244°"},{"_id":"693a8ce8cba8ac949a6c5242","isCorrect":false,"choice":"247°"},{"_id":"693a8ce8cba8ac949a6c5243",